m5x7 Mono and m5x7 Mono Condensed are monospace remixes of m5x7 by Daniel Linssen
(managore), https://managore.itch.io/m5x7

m5x7 is released by its author under Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain dedication): https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

The remixes are generated by nib.ref from the original glyph bitmaps; every
changed glyph is listed with its rule in m5x7-mono-exceptions.txt and
m5x7-mono-condensed-exceptions.txt in the nib repository.
